  },
  {
    "file": "./output/CRUDListSchema.json",
    "line": 761,
    "tag": "description",
    "value": "当配置 keepItemSelectionOnPageChange 时有用，用来配置已勾选项的文案。",
    "translation": "Useful when configuring keepItemSelectionOnPageChange to configure the copy of the checked item."
  },
  {
    "file": "./output/CRUDListSchema.json",
    "line": 765,
    "tag": "description",
    "value": "是否为前端单次加载模式，可以用来实现前端分页。",
    "translation": "Whether it is front-end single loading mode, which can be used to implement front-end paging."
  },
  {
    "file": "./output/CRUDListSchema.json",
    "line": 769,
    "tag": "description",
    "value": "在开启loadDataOnce时，当修改过滤条件时是否重新请求api\\n\\n如果没有配置，当查询条件表单触发的会重新请求 api，当是列过滤或者是 search-box 触发的则不重新请求 api 如果配置为 true，则不管是什么触发都会重新请求 api 如果配置为 false 则不管是什么触发都不会重新请求 api",
    "translation": "When loadDataOnce is turned on, whether to re-request the api when filtering conditions are modified\\n\\nIf there is no configuration, the api will be re-requested when the query condition form is triggered. When it is triggered by column filtering or search-box, the api will not be re-requested. If configured to true, the api will be re-requested no matter what the trigger is. If configured to false, the api will not be re-requested no matter what the trigger is."
  },
  {
    "file": "./output/CRUDListSchema.json",
    "line": 778,
    "tag": "description",
    "value": "自定义搜索匹配函数，当开启loadDataOnce时，会基于该函数计算的匹配结果进行过滤，主要用于处理列字段类型较为复杂或者字段值格式和后端返回不一致的场景\\n\\n参数说明\\n\\n * `items` 当前表格数据  * `itemsRaw` 当前表格数据（未处理）  * `options` 配置  * `options.query` 查询条件  * `options.columns` 列配置  * `options.matchSorter` 系统默认的排序方法",
    "translation": "Custom search matching function, when loadDataOnce is turned on, filtering will be based on the matching results calculated by this function. It is mainly used to deal with scenarios where the column field type is relatively complex or the field value format is inconsistent with the backend return.\\n\\nParameter description\\n\\n * `items` current table data * `itemsRaw` current table data (unprocessed) * `options` configuration * `options.query` query conditions * `options.columns` column configuration * `options.matchSorter` System default sorting method"
  },
  {
