  },
  {
    "file": "./output/FileControlSchema.json",
    "line": 649,
    "tag": "description",
    "value": "如果上传的文件比较小可以设置此选项来简单的把文件 base64 的值给 form 一起提交，目前不支持多选。",
    "translation": "If the uploaded file is relatively small, you can set this option to simply submit the base64 value of the file to the form. Currently, multiple selections are not supported."
  },
  {
    "file": "./output/FileControlSchema.json",
    "line": 653,
    "tag": "description",
    "value": "如果不希望 File 组件上传，可以配置 `asBlob` 或者 `asBase64`，采用这种方式后，组件不再自己上传了，而是直接把文件数据作为表单项的值，文件内容会在 Form 表单提交的接口里面一起带上。",
    "translation": "If you do not want the File component to be uploaded, you can configure `asBlob` or `asBase64`. In this way, the component no longer uploads itself, but directly uses the file data as the value of the form item. The file content will be included in the Form form submission interface."
  },
