  {
    "file": "./output/ListControlSchema.json",
    "line": 53,
    "tag": "description",
    "value": "单选模式：当用户选中某个选项时，选项中的 value 将被作为该表单项的值提交，否则，整个选项对象都会作为该表单项的值提交。 多选模式：选中的多个选项的 `value` 会通过 `delimiter` 连接起来，否则直接将以数组的形式提交值。",
    "translation": "Radio mode: When the user selects an option, the value in the option will be submitted as the value of the form item, otherwise, the entire option object will be submitted as the value of the form item. Multi-selection mode: The `value` of multiple selected options will be connected through `delimiter`, otherwise the value will be submitted directly in the form of an array."
  },
