    "line": 26,
    "tag": "description",
    "value": "开启后将选中的选项 value 的值用连接符拼接起来，作为当前表单项的值。如： `value1,value2` 否则为 `[value1, value2]`",
    "translation": "After it is turned on, the values of the selected option value are spliced together with connectors as the value of the current form item. Such as: `value1,value2` otherwise `[value1, value2]`"
  },
  {
    "file": "./output/MonthRangeControlSchema.json",
    "line": 30,
    "tag": "description",
    "value": "最大日期限制，支持变量  来取值，或者用相对值如：* `-2mins` 2分钟前\\\\n * `+2days` 2天后\\\\n* `-10week` 十周前\\\\n可用单位： `min`、`hour`、`day`、`week`、`month`、`year`。所有单位支持复数形式。",
    "translation": "The maximum date limit supports the variable  to take the value, or use relative values such as: * `-2mins` 2 minutes ago\\\\n * `+2days` 2 days later\\\\n* `-10week` ten weeks ago\\\\n Available units: `min`, `hour`, `day`, `week`, `month`, `year`. All units support plural forms."
  },
  {
    "file": "./output/MonthRangeControlSchema.json",
