    "tag": "description",
    "value": "最小日期限制，支持变量  来取值，或者用相对值如：* `-2mins` 2分钟前\\\\n * `+2days` 2天后\\\\n* `-10week` 十周前\\\\n可用单位： `min`、`hour`、`day`、`week`、`month`、`year`。所有单位支持复数形式。",
    "translation": "Minimum date limit, support variable  to take value, or use relative values such as: * `-2mins` 2 minutes ago\\\\n * `+2days` 2 days later\\\\n* `-10week` ten weeks ago\\\\n Available units: `min`, `hour`, `day`, `week`, `month`, `year`. All units support plural forms."
  },
