    "value": "多选模式，值太多时是否避免折行",
    "translation": "Multi-select mode, whether to avoid line wrapping when there are too many values"
  },
  {
    "file": "./output/TransferPickerControlSchema.json",
    "line": 973,
    "tag": "description",
    "value": "开启后将选中的选项 value 的值封装为数组，作为当前表单项的值。",
