    "translation": "Used to initialize form data"
  },
  {
    "file": "./output/SubFormControlSchema.json",
    "line": 858,
    "tag": "description",
    "value": "Form 用来获取初始数据的 api,与initApi不同的是，会一直轮询请求该接口，直到返回 finished 属性为 true 才 结束。",
    "translation": "The API used by Form to obtain initial data is different from initApi in that it will keep polling and requesting this interface until the finished attribute is returned as true."
  },
  {
    "file": "./output/SubFormControlSchema.json",
    "line": 862,
    "tag": "description",
    "value": "设置了initAsyncApi后，默认会从返回数据的data.finished来判断是否完成，也可以设置成其他的xxx，就会从data.xxx中获取",
    "translation": "After setting initAsyncApi, by default, it will judge whether it is completed from the data.finished of the returned data. It can also be set to other xxx, and it will be obtained from data.xxx"
  },
  {
