  {
    "file": "./output/SubFormControlSchema.json",
    "line": 912,
    "tag": "description",
    "value": "Form 用来保存数据的 api。\\n\\n详情：https://aisuda.bce.baidu.com/amis/zh-CN/components/form/index#%E8%A1%A8%E5%8D%95%E6%8F%90%E4%BA%A4",
    "translation": "API used by Form to save data. \\n\\nDetails: https://aisuda.bce.baidu.com/amis/zh-CN/components/form/index#%E8%A1%A8%E5%8D%95%E6%8F%90%E4%BA%A4"
  },
  {
    "file": "./output/SubFormControlSchema.json",
    "line": 915,
    "tag": "description",
    "value": "Form 也可以配置 feedback。",
    "translation": "Form can also be configured with feedback."
  },
  {
    "file": "./output/SubFormControlSchema.json",
    "line": 926,
    "tag": "description",
    "value": "设置此属性后，表单提交发送保存接口后，还会继续轮询请求该接口，直到返回 finished 属性为 true 才 结束。",
    "translation": "After setting this attribute, after the form is submitted and the save interface is sent, the interface will continue to be polled and requested until the finished attribute is returned to true."
  },
  {
    "file": "./output/SubFormControlSchema.json",
