    "translation": "Multi-select mode, whether to avoid line wrapping when there are too many values"
  },
  {
    "file": "./output/TreeControlSchema.json",
    "line": 65,
    "tag": "description",
    "value": "开启后将选中的选项 value 的值封装为数组，作为当前表单项的值。",
    "translation": "After it is turned on, the value of the selected option value is encapsulated into an array and used as the value of the current form item."
  },
  {
