  {
    "file": "./output/TreeControlSchema.json",
    "line": 885,
    "tag": "description",
    "value": "ui级联关系，true代表级联选中，false代表不级联，默认为true",
    "translation": "ui cascade relationship, true represents cascade selection, false represents no cascade, the default is true"
  },
  {
    "file": "./output/TreeControlSchema.json",
    "line": 889,
    "tag": "description",
    "value": "该属性代表数据级联关系，autoCheckChildren为true时生效，默认为false，具体数据级联关系如下： 1.casacde为false，ui行为为级联选中子节点，子节点禁用；值只包含父节点的值 2.cascade为false，withChildren为true，ui行为为级联选中子节点，子节点禁用；值包含父子节点的值 3.cascade为true，ui行为级联选中子节点，子节点可反选，值包含父子节点的值，此时withChildren属性失效 4.cascade不论为true还是false，onlyChildren为true，ui行为级联选中子节点，子节点可反选，值只包含子节点的值",
    "translation": "This attribute represents the data cascade relationship. It takes effect when autoCheckChildren is true. The default is false. The specific data cascade relationship is as follows: 1.casacde is false, the UI behavior is cascade selected child nodes, child nodes are disabled; the value only contains the value of the parent node. 2.cascade is false, withChildren is true, the ui behavior is cascade selected child nodes, child nodes are disabled; the value contains the value of the parent and child nodes. 3.cascade is true, the ui behavior cascade selects the child node, the child node can be inverted, the value contains the value of the parent and child nodes, and the withChildren attribute is invalid. 4. Regardless of whether cascade is true or false, onlyChildren is true, the ui behavior cascade selects the child node, the child node can be inversely selected, and the value only contains the value of the child node."
  },
  {
    "file": "./output/TreeControlSchema.json",
    "line": 900,
    "tag": "description",
    "value": "节点行为配置，默认为选中",
    "translation": "Node behavior configuration, selected by default"
  },
